DTSTART:20261126T120500
DTEND:20261126T121500
SUMMARY:🦃 Turkey out to rest + Stuffing out + Sprouts in
DESCRIPTION:• Turkey out when the breast reads 150°F and the thighs re
 ad 165°F or higher. Rest it uncovered for 25–30 min.\n• Take the st
 uffing out too (165°F in the center) and cover it to keep warm.\n• Sp
 routs in: toss with olive oil\, salt and pepper on a sheet pan. Roast 20
 –25 min\, shaking once.\n\nhttps://www.aajbaker.com/thanksgiving/
URL:https://www.aajbaker.com/thanksgiving/
BEGIN:VALARM
ACTION:DISPLAY
DESCRIPTION:🦃 Turkey out to rest + Stuffing out + Sprouts in
