SUMMARY:Drippings into turkey gravy + Check mushroom gravy
DESCRIPTION:• Strain the pan drippings\, skim off the fat\, and taste t
 hem (dry-brine drippings are salty). Whisk them into the turkey gravy on
 ly. Simmer and season.\n• Thin the mushroom gravy with a splash of veg
 etable stock if needed.\n\nhttps://www.aajbaker.com/thanksgiving/
